\v 5 God¦50 named the¦52 light¦52 \em daytime\em*, and¦54 the¦54 darkness¦54 he¦55 named \em nighttime¦56\em*. Then¦49 evening¦59 came, and¦60 \add later\add* morning¦62 came, \add and that was the end of the\add* first day¦63.
