\p
\v 14 After¦5310 Lot¦5313 had left, Yahweh¦5305 told¦5306 Abram¦5309, “Look¦5318 all around you¦5324 towards the north¦5326, the south¦5327, the east¦5328, and¦5305 the¦5321 west¦5329,
\v 15 because¦5331 all¦5334 that land¦5336 that¦5337 you¦5339 can see¦5340, I'll¦5332 give¦5342 it¦5342 to you and¦5343 to your¦5343 descendants¦5343 to have forever¦5346.\x + \xo 13:15: \xt Acts 7:5.\x*
\v 16 I'll¦5348 make¦5348 your descendants \add as numerous\add* as¦5352 dust¦5352 \add particles\add*. Your descendants will¦5358 only be¦5358 able to be counted¦5360 if¦5356 someone's able to count¦5360 all the¦5363 dust¦5363 \add particles\add* on the¦5364 earth¦5364.
\v 17 \add So,\add* go¦5371 and \add start\add* walking¦5371 throughout the¦5372 land¦5372—through its length¦5373 and its width¦5374, because¦5375 I'm giving¦5377 it¦5377 \add all\add* to¦5376 you.”
