\p
\v 1 At the¦5395 time¦5395 when Amrafel¦5396 was king¦5397 of¦5397 Shinar¦5399, Arioch¦5400 was king¦5401 of¦5401 Ellasar¦5402, Kedorlaomer¦5403 was king¦5404 of¦5404 Elam¦5405, and¦5406 Tidal¦5406 was king¦5407 of¦5407 the Goyim¦5408,
\v 2 they¦5410 went to war¦5411 against Bera¦5414 king¦5415 of¦5415 Sodom¦5416, Birsha¦5419 king¦5420 of¦5420 Amorah¦5421 \add !(Gomorrah¦5421)\add*, Shinab¦5422 king¦5424 of¦5424 Admah¦5425, Shemeber¦5426 king¦5427 of¦5427 Tsevoim¦5428, and¦5431 the¦5431 king¦5431 of¦5431 Bela¦5432 (also¦5417 known as Tso'ar¦5435).
\v 3 Those latter five kings joined¦5440 forces in the Siddim¦5444 valley (also known as the Salt¦5447 Sea¦5446 valley).
