\p
\v 21 Then¦5749 the¦5750 king¦5750 of¦5750 Sodom¦5752 said¦5749 to¦5753 Abram¦5755, “Give¦5756 my people back to¦5758 me¦5758, but¦5749 keep the possessions¦5760 for¦5763 yourself.”
