\v 22 \add But\add* Abram¦5766 said¦5765 to¦5767 the¦5769 king¦5769 of¦5769 Sodom¦5770, “I¦5771 promise by Yahweh¦5775, most¦5777 high¦5777 God¦5776, the¦5778 owner of¦5778 heaven¦5779 and¦5765 earth¦5780,
