\p
\v 1 After¦5823 those¦5826 events, Yahweh¦5830 spoke to¦5831 Abram in¦5834 a vision¦5834, telling¦5835 him, “Don't¦5836 be¦5844 afraid¦5838, Abram, because¦5842 I'll protect you and I'll generously and richly reward¦5843 you.”
