\v 7 He¦6956 ran¦6942 to the¦6941 herd¦6941 and¦6944 selected a tender¦6948 and¦6949 choice¦6949 calf and took¦6944 it¦6950 to¦6951 a slave¦6953 who hurried¦6954 to prepare it¦6956.
