\v 3 So¦9008 Abraham¦9009 got¦9015 up¦9027 early¦9008 in¦9010 the morning¦9010 and¦9011 saddled¦9011 his donkey¦9014. Then he¦9015 took¦9015 two¦9018 of¦9018 his¦9019 young¦9019 men¦9019 with¦9010 him¦9020 and¦9021 his¦9023 son¦9023 Yitshak¦9022, and¦9024 he¦9024 cut¦9024 \add some\add* firewood¦9025 for the burnt¦9026 offering¦9026. Then they left¦9028 to go¦9028 to¦9029 the¦9031 place¦9031 that¦9032 God¦9037 had¦9034 told¦9034 him¦9036.
