\v 3 \add After a time,\add* Abraham¦9455 got up¦9454 from¦9456 beside his¦9458 dead¦9458 \add wife\add* and¦9454 he¦9459 spoke¦9459 to¦9460 the¦9462 Hitties, \add requesting\add*,
\v 4 “I'm a foreigner¦9469 and¦9469 just staying among you. Give¦9472 me¦9473 property¦9474 for a burial¦9476 place¦9476 \add on your land\add* so¦9478 that¦9478 I¦9478 can bury¦9478 my¦9480 dead¦9479 \add wife\add*.”\x + \xo 23:4: \xt Heb 11:9,13; Acts 7:16.\x*
