\p
\v 10 Then¦9946 the¦9947 slave¦9947 took¦9946 ten¦9948 of¦9950 his¦9951 master's¦9951 camels¦9949 and \add loaded them with\add* all¦9953 kinds of good¦9955 things¦9955 from¦9950 his¦9956 master¦9956, and¦9958 \add with his own slaves,\add* he¦9958 travelled to¦9960 the¦9966 city¦9966 of¦9966 Nahor¦9967 in¦9957 the Aram¦9962-Naharaim¦9963 \add region\add*.
\v 11 Then¦9969 on that first evening¦9978, he¦9969 made¦9969 the¦9970 camels¦9970 kneel¦9969 down outside¦9971 the city¦9972 by the¦9975 well¦9975. It was the time¦9977 that women¦9981 come¦9980 out¦9980 to¦9973 fetch water¦9976,
