\v 13 See, I'm¦10002 standing¦10003 by this \add well\add*, and¦10008 the¦10008 young women¦10008 from the city¦10010 will¦10011 be coming¦10011 out¦10011 \add here\add* to¦10012 fetch water¦10013.
