\p
\v 15 Now before he'd even finished¦10049 speaking¦10050, then¦10045 wow, Rebekah¦10052 arrived¦10053 with her \add empty\add* water jar¦10064 on¦10065 her shoulder¦10067. (She¦10055 was¦10065 Bethuel's¦10056 daughter—Bethuel being the¦10057 son¦10057 of¦10067 Abraham's¦10063 brother¦10062 Nahor¦10061 and¦10045 his wife¦10060 Milcah¦10059.)
