\v 22 Then¦10146 when the¦10149 camels¦10149 had¦10148 finished¦10148 drinking¦10150, the slave took¦10151 out an \add expensive\add* gold nose ring¦10153 and¦10146 two¦10157 \add solid\add* gold bracelets¦10158 for her¦10161 arms.
\v 23 “Tell¦10171 me¦10173, whose daughter¦10167 are¦10170 you¦10170?” he¦10166 asked¦10166 her¦10177. “Is¦10174 there¦10174 room¦10178 at your¦10177 father's¦10177 house¦10175 for¦10179 us¦10179 to¦10180 stay¦10180?”
