\v 30 He¦10259 had seen¦10261 the¦10264 nose ring¦10264 and¦10265 the¦10267 bracelets¦10267 on¦10268 his¦10271 sister's¦10271 arms, and¦10272 when he'd heard¦10272 his sister Rebekah's¦10276 words¦10275 saying¦10281, “This¦10288 is what the man said¦10281 to¦10282 me¦10282,” then¦10259 he went¦10284 to¦10285 the¦10287 man¦10287, and¦10288 indeed, he¦10289 was¦10289 \add there\add* standing¦10289 by the¦10292 camels¦10292 at¦10293 the¦10295 spring¦10295
