\v 21 \add So\add* Yacob \add took his household\add* and everything that¦14696 belonged to¦14698 \add them\add* and crossed¦14700 the¦14703 \add Euphrates\add* River¦14703 and¦14704 \add headed upward\add* toward the¦14708 hill-country of¦14708 Gilead¦14709.
\s1 Lavan catches up to Yacob
