\v 2 There¦18443 Yehudah¦18444 saw¦18441 the daughter¦18445 of¦18445 a Canaanite¦18448 man¦18447 named¦18449 Shua¦18450, and¦18441 he¦18451 took¦18451 her¦18451 \add as a wife\add*. He¦18452 \add slept with\add* her¦18453
