\v 4 Then¦18464 she¦18464 got pregnant¦18464 again¦18465 and¦18466 gave¦18466 birth¦18466 a \add another\add* son¦18467, and¦18468 she¦18468 named¦18468 him Onan¦18469.
\v 5 Then¦18474 she¦18474 \add got pregnant yet again\add* and¦18476 gave¦18476 birth¦18476 to a \add third\add* son¦18477, and¦18478 she¦18478 named¦18478 him¦18486 Shelah¦18482. (\add Yehudah\add* was¦18483 in¦18484 Kezib¦18484 when¦18485 she¦18485 \add Onan was born\add*.)
