\v 6 \add In due course,\add* Yehudah¦18489 took¦18488 a wife¦18490 for¦18491 Er¦18491 his¦18492 firstborn¦18492, and¦18493 her¦18493 name¦18493 was¦18494 Tamar¦18494.
\v 7 But¦18496 Er¦18497 was¦18496 evil¦18500 in¦18501 Yahweh's¦18502 eyes¦18501, so Yahweh¦18504 killed¦18503 him¦18503.
\v 8 Then¦18506 Yehudah¦18507 said¦18506 to¦18508 Onan¦18508, “Go¦18509 to¦18510 your brother's¦18513 wife¦18512 and¦18506 perform¦18514 your \add brotherly\add* duty to her¦18515 \add to\add* produce¦18516 \add children\add* for¦18518 your brother.”
