\v 27 Then¦22901 they¦22901 told him¦22902 \add everything\add* that Yosef¦22907 had¦22909 told them¦22910. \add When\add* he¦22911 saw¦22911 the¦22914 carts¦22914 that¦22915 Yosef had¦22917 sent¦22917 to¦22919 carry¦22919 him, then¦22901 \add he started to recover from the shock\add*.
