\p “I'm¦22966 \add listening\add*,” he¦22961 answered¦22955.
\v 3 Then¦22968 \add God\add* told¦22968 \add him\add*, “I'm¦22969 God¦22970, the¦22971 god¦22971 of¦22971 your¦22972 father¦22972. Don't¦22973 be¦22975 afraid¦22975 to go¦22976 down¦22976 to¦22977 Egypt¦22977, because¦22978 I'll¦22972 make¦22982 you¦22982 into a great¦22981 nation¦22980 there¦22983.
\v 4 I myself will¦22986 go¦22986 down¦22986 with¦22987 you¦22987 to¦22988 Egypt¦22988, and¦22989 I myself will also¦22989 surely bring¦22990 you¦22990 \add back here\add*. And¦22994 Yosef¦22994 will¦22995 \add be there with you when you die\add*.”
