\v 13 Then¦24276 Yosef¦24277 took¦24276 both¦24280 of¦24280 them¦24280—Efrayim¦24283 on his¦24284 right¦24284 toward Yisra'el's left¦24285 and¦24287 Manasseh¦24289 \add (the eldest)\add* on his¦24290 left¦24290 toward Yisra'el's right¦24291—and¦24293 brought¦24293 them¦24293 close¦24293 to¦24294 him¦24294.
